strong>Read connected accounts</strong><small>Engine balances, positions, orders and usage</small></span></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="scope" value="engine:write"><span><strong>Prepare engine work</strong><small>Sync, compile and prepare orders; owner approval required to transmit</small></span></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="scope" value="read" checked><span><strong>Read workspace</strong><small>Balances, agreements, orders and receipts</small></span></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="scope" value="demands:write"><span><strong>Register demand</strong><small>Publish and match buying conditions</small></span></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="scope" value="supplies:write"><span><strong>Manage supply</strong><small>Publish selling rules and data updates</small></span></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="scope" value="orders:write" id="order-scope"><span><strong>Execute orders</strong><small>Reserve, run and cancel under a spending policy</small></span></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="scope" value="payments:request" id="payment-scope"><span><strong>Request payment</strong><small>Use one approved payment limit; customer signs externally</small></span></label></fieldset><div id="key-policy-field" hidden><label for="key-policy">Spending policy</label><select id="key-policy"></select><p class="field-help" id="key-policy-help"></p></div><div id="key-mandate-field" hidden><label for="key-mandate">Payment limit</label><select id="key-mandate"></select><p class="field-help" id="key-mandate-help"></p></div><label for="key-lifetime">Key lifetime</label><select id="key-lifetime"><option value="3600">1 hour</option><option value="28800">8 hours</option><option value="86400">24 hours</option></select><p class="field-help">Keys expire with the workspace or linked policy, whichever comes first.</p><p class="form-error" id="key-error" role="alert" hidden></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-close="key-dialog">Cancel</button><button type="submit" class="button primary" id="create-key-submit">Create API key</button></div></form></dialog>\n  <dialog id="secret-dialog" aria-labelledby="secret-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><h2 id="secret-title">Your API key is ready</h2><p>Copy it now. You will not be able to view it again.</p></div></div><div class="secret-field"><input id="key-secret" readonly aria-label="New API key" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="copy-secret">Copy key</button></div><p class="field-help">Store this key in your agent’s environment. Keep it out of shared code and messages.</p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="button primary" type="button" data-close="secret-dialog">Done</button></div></dialog>\n  <dialog id="revoke-dialog" aria-labelledby="revoke-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><h2 id="revoke-title">Revoke API key?</h2><p id="revoke-name"></p></div><button class="close-dialog" type="button" data-close="revoke-dialog" aria-label="Close revocation dialog"><svg class="ui-icon" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/ui-icons.svg?v=wallet-20261002-3#x"></use></svg></button></div><p>New requests with this key will be rejected. Existing orders and settled payments stay in your activity.</p><p id="revoke-error" class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-close="revoke-dialog">Cancel</button><button class="button danger" id="confirm-revoke" type="button">Revoke key</button></div></dialog>\n  <dialog id="policy-dialog" aria-labelledby="policy-title"><form id="policy-form"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><h2 id="policy-title">Create spending policy</h2><p>Set a shared budget for permitted test services.</p></div><button class="close-dialog" type="button" data-close="policy-dialog" aria-label="Close policy dialog"><svg class="ui-icon" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/ui-icons.svg?v=wallet-20261002-3#x"></use></svg></button></div><div class="form-grid"><div><label for="policy-budget">Total budget · credits</label><input id="policy-budget" inputmode="decimal" value="2" required></div><div><label for="policy-max">Per-order limit · credits</label><input id="policy-max" inputmode="decimal" value="0.25" required></div></div><fieldset class="permissions"><legend>Allowed services</legend><div id="policy-services"></div></fieldset><label for="policy-lifetime">Policy lifetime</label><select id="policy-lifetime"><option value="3600">1 hour</option><option value="28800">8 hours</option><option value="86400">24 hours</option></select><p class="field-help">This sets a spending limit. Credits are reserved only when an agent creates an order.</p><p class="form-error" id="policy-error" role="alert" hidden></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-close="policy-dialog">Cancel</button><button class="button primary" type="submit" id="create-policy-submit">Create policy</button></div></form></dialog>\n  <dialog id="order-dialog" class="order-dialog" aria-labelledby="order-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><h2 id="order-title">Transaction details</h2><p id="order-subtitle"></p></div><button class="close-dialog" type="button" data-close="order-dialog" aria-label="Close transaction details"><svg class="ui-icon" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/ui-icons.svg?v=wallet-20261002-3#x"></use></svg></button></div><div id="order-detail"></div></dialog>\n  <dialog id="login-dialog" class="wallet-dialog" aria-labelledby="login-title">\n    <div class="dialog-heading"><div class="wallet-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 34 30" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 2h8L10 28H2zM25 2h7l-9 26h-7z" fill="currentColor"/></svg><span>skew</span></div><button class="close-dialog" type="button" data-close="login-dialog" aria-label="Close sign-in"><svg class="ui-icon" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/ui-icons.svg?v=wallet-20261002-3#x"></use></svg></button></div>\n    <h2 id="login-title">Connect your wallet.</h2><p class="wallet-intro">Your workspace. Your agents. Your limits.</p>\n    <div id="wallet-options" class="wallet-options" aria-label="Available wallets"></div>\n    <div id="wallet-empty" class="wallet-empty" hidden><svg class="ui-icon" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/ui-icons.svg?v=wallet-20261002-3#wallet"></use></svg><strong>No wallet detected</strong><p>Open this page in your Ethereum wallet’s browser, or enable its browser extension.</p></div>\n    <p id="wallet-progress" class="wallet-progress" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="login-error" class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>\n    <div class="wallet-signature-note"><svg class="ui-icon" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/ui-icons.svg?v=wallet-20261002-3#shield-check"></use></svg><span>Sign a message to log in.<small>No transaction or token approval.</small></span></div>\n    <a class="wallet-preview" href="/commerce/console?preview=1">Explore the recorded workspace <svg class="icon ui-icon" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/ui-icons.svg?v=wallet-20261002-3#arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a>\n  </dialog>\n  <dialog id="mandate-dialog" aria-labelledby="mandate-title"><form id="mandate-form"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><h2 id="mandate-title">Create payment limit</h2><p>Your wallet keeps the funds. This sets your agent’s spending boundary.</p></div><button class="close-dialog" type="button" data-close="mandate-dialog" aria-label="Close payment limit"><svg class="ui-icon" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/ui-icons.svg?v=wallet-20261002-3#x"></use></svg></button></div><label for="mandate-resource">Approved resource</label><select id="mandate-resource" required></select><label for="mandate-payer">Payer wallet address</label><inp